###> Claude Code ###
# Only the shared project configuration is versioned: settings, skills, subagents,
# commands and hook scripts. Everything else in .claude/ stays local and private
# (settings.local.json, worktrees/, agent memory and other per-user files).
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/hooks/
# Personal, per-developer instructions for Claude
CLAUDE.local.md
###< Claude Code ###

###> Docker Compose ###
# Local Compose profile, e.g. an isolated project of an agent working in a worktree
# (COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME, IMAGES_PREFIX, ports). Never committed.
/.env
docker-compose.override.yml
